# Integer8 power within range

Verifies int8 exponentiation with base and exponent chosen to stay inside
the 8-bit range through the complete CLI pipeline. Both operands are int8 to
keep this case focused on same-type power semantics.

>>> source
const base: int8 = 2
const exponent: int8 = 6

const power: int8 = base ** exponent
print(power)

<<< stdout
64

<<< stderr
